      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight sheer layered polyester fabric; exact fiber composition was not visible in the supplied evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A soft mother-daughter dress moment for sunny photos, garden days, vacations, and weekend celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Pastel Watercolor blends pink, peach, yellow, and green floral washes over an airy light ground.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Sleeveless gathered neckline, flowing overlay, and a layered skirt-style silhouette shown for both mom and daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and cool iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 1-2 Years through Child 9-10 Years, plus Mother S through Mother 2XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n<th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>8.5-11 kg / 18.7-24.3 lbs</td>\n<td>75-85 cm / 29.5-33.5 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>67 cm / 26.4 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>11-14 kg / 24.3-30.9 lbs</td>\n<td>85-95 cm / 33.5-37.4 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>63 cm / 24.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>14-16.5 kg / 30.9-36.4 lbs</td>\n<td>95-105 cm / 37.4-41.3 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16.5-20 kg / 36.4-44.1 lbs</td>\n<td>105-115 cm / 41.3-45.3 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>76 cm / 29.9 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>18.5-24 kg / 40.8-52.9 lbs</td>\n<td>115-125 cm / 45.3-49.2 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>79 cm / 31.1 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>24-27.5 kg / 52.9-60.6 lbs</td>\n<td>125-130 cm / 49.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>27.5-32.5 kg / 60.6-71.7 lbs</td>\n<td>130-140 cm / 51.2-55.1 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>85 cm / 33.5 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32.5-37.5 kg / 71.7-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td>140-150 cm / 55.1-59.1 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>93 cm / 36.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>42.5-50 kg / 93.7-110.2 lbs</td>\n<td>155-160 cm / 61.0-63.0 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>50-57.5 kg / 110.2-126.8 lbs</td>\n<td>160-165 cm / 63.0-65.0 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>59-69 kg / 130.1-152.1 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>70-80 kg / 154.3-176.4 lbs</td>\n<td>160-175 cm / 63.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>80-92.5 kg / 176.4-203.9 lbs</td>\n<td>160-175 cm / 63.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Pastel Watercolor brings mom and daughter into the same breezy floral story without making the look feel too formal. The soft layered shape, sleeveless neckline, and painterly colors make it easy for family photos, outdoor parties, and warm-weather trips.</p>\n\n<p>The attached chart is fit-reference-only, so the variants are anchored to the vendor's published height and weight rows while garment measurements are carried from the closest live Dress Like Mommy dress grading for an honest shopper table.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Mother-daughter sizing:</strong> Girl and Mother dress rows only, per the request.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Pastel floral palette:</strong> Pink, peach, yellow, and green tones coordinate softly for photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Airy layered look:</strong> Sleeveless overlay styling keeps the dress light and movement-friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed variants:</strong> Every live variant maps to a row from the attached size chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Draft-only review:</strong> Created unpublished so merchandising can review duplication and fabric details before launch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your matching sizes and build a soft, photo-ready mommy-and-me dress look for the next sunny family plan.</p>",
